<title>USA: IES Iowa nuke shut for scheduled refueling.</title>
<headline>IES Iowa nuke shut for scheduled refueling.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>IES Utilities' 538 megawatt Duane Arnold nuclear unit 2 in Palo, Iowa, was shut Friday morning for a scheduled maintenance and refueling outage, the company said today.</p>
<p>The unit is expected to be down for 30-36 days, said company spokesman Tom Peterson.</p>
<p>IES Utilities is a unit of IES Industries Inc.</p>
<p>--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
